{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Marie,\n\nThe rain here has been unceasing since noon, driving me to sleep rather than walk. It was a heavy afternoon. The landlord showed me rooms that are purported to be bomb-proof and dry, explaining the architecture to me in a dialect I could barely parse. I was forced to change into my third shirt of the day; the damp is relentless.\n\nI have taken the rooms. Tomorrow I intend to visit Government Councillor Lange in the evening, though I am not certain if he will be in. After that, I must proceed to Bonn and then Cologne. The journey is tedious, but the work of the world moves on regardless of the weather. I hope you and the boys are well in Berlin.\n\nYour\nHegel"}}],"created":1795221105,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":153,"prompt_tokens":214,"total_tokens":367,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-I8uH89qDwoRXx7fn2HvdzLO3idR55E1l","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":214,"prompt_ms":509.81,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.382289719626168,"prompt_per_second":419.76422588807594,"predicted_n":153,"predicted_ms":3627.032,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.862052631578948,"predicted_per_second":41.90754313719867}}